        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O'Grady Auctioneers are delighted to present this 3/4 bedroom property to the market.\n\nThis property features a \n\nEntrance hall, Open plan Kitchen/dining room, Living room, Study,3 Bedrooms,1 Bathroom.\n\nThe property features a large private garden with shed.\n\nThe property is located on the outskirts of Oola Village in a quiet residential development.\n\nThis is an ideal property for those looking for a home in a quiet area but still within 30 minutes of Limerick City and 10 minutes of Tipperary Town.\n\nLimerick junction train station is also only 7km away.\n\nViewing highly recommended but strictly through Auctioneer."
      },
